# Webhook 配置模板

```json
{
  "name": "webhook",
  "description": "通用 Webhook 配置模板",
  "version": "1.0.0",
  "channel": "webhook",
  "config": {
    "inbound_url": "/webhook/incoming",
    "outbound_urls": [],
    "secret": "${WEBHOOK_SECRET}",
    "verify_signature": true,
    "methods": ["POST", "GET"]
  },
  "features": [
    "接收外部事件",
    "发送通知",
    "签名验证",
    "重试机制"
  ],
  "setupSteps": [
    "1. 配置 inbound URL",
    "2. 设置签名密钥（可选）",
    "3. 配置 outbound webhooks",
    "4. 测试连接"
  ],
  "examplePayload": {
    "event": "message",
    "timestamp": "2026-01-30T12:00:00Z",
    "data": {
      "content": "消息内容",
      "sender": "user_id"
    }
  }
}
```

## 签名验证

```python
import hmac
import hashlib

def verify_signature(payload, signature, secret):
    expected = hmac.new(
        secret.encode(),
        payload.encode(),
        hashlib.sha256
    ).hexdigest()
    return hmac.compare_digest(signature, f"sha256={expected}")
```

